    "sentence_translations": [
      "Buying A Coat",
      "",
      "One day, Little Ming’s mom said: “My husband, it’s too cold. You should buy a coat for me!”",
      "",
      "Little Ming’s dad asked: “How much is it?”",
      "",
      "Mom replied: “30,000 yuan!”",
      "",
      "Dad thought for a bit, and said: “Any 30,000 yuan coat is still inferior to your thin 2 feet waist!”",
      "“A woman’s most valuable clothing is her figure. Why would you need to buy a coat?”",
      "",
      "Little Mom was tricked but still felt delighted.",
      "",
      "Beside them, Little Ming suddenly said:",
      "“If you put a 30,000 yuan coat on a thin 2 feet waist, isn’t that even more beautiful?”"
    ]
  }
